{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#card-zh","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance 是供 DSH web 客户端使用的余额显示插件。它把余额文字放在对话输入框的模型选择器旁，并在选中模型后按该模型的提供方读取账户余额。host 端通过凭据服务解析对应提供方的 API key，尝试 DeepSeek 余额接口和 OpenAI 风格的账单额度接口，再将结果转换成统一格式。用户可查看当前余额、每分钟自动刷新或点击立即更新；未选择模型时隐藏显示。适合希望在编写提示词时顺手查看模型账户余额的 DSH 用户。需要在 DSH 凭据和提供方设置中配置对应 API key 与 base URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:162-183","client/client.js:110-139","lib/index.js:184-242"]}
{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#card-en","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-balance shows the selected model provider’s account balance beside the DSH web composer. Its host route retrieves the provider credential, checks supported balance APIs, and normalizes results. The balance refreshes every minute or on click. Configure the provider API key and base URL in DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:162-183","client/client.js:110-139","lib/index.js:184-242"]}
