{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#feature-1","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"余额座位显示：dsh-balance 在对话输入框右侧的工具区域注册余额文字，紧邻模型选择器。只有当前会话选中有效模型时才显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:162-178"]}
{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#feature-2","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"按提供方查询余额：选择模型后，插件将提供方标识交给 host 路由；host 使用相应设置和凭据查询余额，并统一返回可用状态、金额与更新时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:105-120"]}
{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#feature-3","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"余额自动与手动刷新：余额显示每 60 秒请求一次；用户点击余额文字也会立即重新请求，加载或失败时显示相应状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:94-118"]}
{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#feature-4","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"支持多种余额接口：host 先尝试 DeepSeek 风格的 user/balance，再尝试 OpenAI 风格的 credit_grants 接口，并归一化响应；不支持的提供方返回说明性错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:207-238"]}
{"unit_id":"kkbsgg__dsh-balance#caveat-1","repo":"kkbsgg/dsh-balance","commit":"e65ea1b0f2900f992dd3fe58eb46f0c9dd280e9d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance 查询余额时会向所选提供方的 base URL 发送带 Bearer 凭据的请求；需要为相应提供方配置 API key 和 base URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:128-134","lib/index.js:189-207"]}
